{"time": 1752513724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847521958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1752513911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1210696670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "再次睁开眼，你在领主家自己的房间内醒来，身体已经全身包扎，体内时不时传来魔力爆发带来的隐痛，现在你的魔力仍然像以前一样用不了，而且你感觉由于之前的被动爆发，魔力量有所下降。"}
{"time": 1752513946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981404812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林正趴在你床边睡觉，脸上带着泪痕"}
{"time": 1752513996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513901167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”比痛感最先传到头脑的是沉重的失落感，抬起手看看，咬着牙"}
{"time": 1752514012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940486214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（看什么，手镯吗）"}
{"time": 1752514017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423558024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（是的）"}
{"time": 1752514062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665561729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你仍然戴着那个手镯，这也是为什么你如今使用不了自己的魔力"}
{"time": 1752514169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742622362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”盯着手镯发呆，最终喟然叹了口气，放下手，几滴眼泪不甘心地从眼角滑落"}
{"time": 1752514266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815684889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "吱呀一声门被轻轻推开，是小安琪，她惊讶地跑出去“师傅醒了！，爸爸，师傅醒了！”"}
{"time": 1752514416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197304441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "尽力抿着嘴，徒然地看着天花板，茫然和失意占据了身心"}
{"time": 1752514565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781742059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林也被吵醒了，她握住你的手“你终于醒了……”"}
{"time": 1752514634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697049529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "微微偏过头看向她，眼底只有茫然无措和深深的自弃，“...”"}
{"time": 1752514921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937375289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“对不起师傅，瞒了你这么久，之前你一个人去挑战赤龙差点死掉，我就很害怕，我害怕再次遇到危险时只能眼睁睁看着你死在我面前，所以……所以我在你养伤的时候找铁匠大叔教我，在领主家找吉诺教我，我本来想给你个惊喜，然后能与你并肩作战的……我真的错了，我不该瞒着你的……”格林声泪俱下，一边哭着一边向你解释"}
{"time": 1752515034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867441017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...格林..”不知道嗓子的状态，尝试开口"}
{"time": 1752515141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311616877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "嗓子没有受伤"}
{"time": 1752515328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737818263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"格林...保护弟子，是作为师傅的...使命。你不用...自责，是师傅...技不如人...\"闭上眼转过头到另一边，睁开看着墙，\"什么都做不到，也许...桃乐丝本来就...不配当师傅吧...\"由于身体的原因，说话有些费劲"}
{"time": 1752515451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534683811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“师傅你不要这么说……你是世界上最好的师傅……”"}
{"time": 1752515711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429069294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...没有魔力的魔法师...\"感觉一阵苦涩，\"桃乐丝...\"咬着嘴唇，\"...对不起...格林，擅自卷入你的生活...我果然...死在塔里就好了。\"眼眶有些湿润感，撑着没掉下眼泪"}
{"time": 1752515874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602649670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"每次都是...我的任性...阿桃很对不起。\"吸了吸鼻子，有些哽咽，\"..\""}
{"time": 1752515983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1714203474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不是这样的……”格林反复地重复着这句话"}
{"time": 1752516179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648965848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "闭上双眼，不知道能说什么，\"桃乐丝是没用的师傅...格林说得是对的...\"说完就不再言语，只有偶尔的呼吸声"}
{"time": 1752516409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857773542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "这个时候领主进来了，身后跟着安琪，他坐在你床边，对你表示关心“桃乐丝，感觉现在身体怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1752516418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891220237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（话说你角色卡还没改名字）"}
{"time": 1752516422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024846286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（还是天宫安）"}
{"time": 1752516469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048858151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。nn 桃乐丝"}
{"time": 1752516469, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2048858151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[天宫安]将乐谱的曲名更改为[桃乐丝]"}
{"time": 1752516788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079371633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1857773542]\"...\"深深地看了他一眼，\"恐怕...我无法继续担任教师了...\"随后闭上眼，\"契约取消吧...杀了我也好...送去塔里也好...都无所谓了...\"停顿了一下，\"让格林好好的...算阿桃求您。\""}
{"time": 1752517243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467391256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“事情的经过，我听格林说过了……我确实是没有料到你们会遭到袭击，所以一直束缚着你们，是我考虑不周了……不过，要不还是再考虑考虑吧，契约的事”"}
{"time": 1752517588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545988893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...考虑..吗？\"睁开眼抬起手看着手镯有些出神，\"说到底...阿桃有考虑的机会吗？\"缩回手，良久幽幽开口，\"把格林的解开吧，我会留下的，本来也是我害了她。\""}
{"time": 1752517886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294675496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯，我会的，另外，你的手镯我也放松一点限制吧，至少……至少不应该再发生这种情况了”"}
{"time": 1752518019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014918926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有什么区别...\"喃喃重复几遍，\"请你走吧。\""}
{"time": 1752518056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159170222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"阿桃无所谓...没关系...\""}
{"time": 1752518180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "129746486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“唉”领主帮格林取下手镯，帮你解开部分限制后带着安琪离开了"}
{"time": 1752518248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461012999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "现在你感觉自己已经能够使用魔法，但是魔法的威力似乎只能到一定的程度，而且像次元魔法这种大魔法大概还是用不了"}
{"time": 1752518263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443481440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "意思就是只有普通成功"}
{"time": 1752518271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928244877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1752518288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101319592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“师傅……”"}
{"time": 1752518359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622991213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"......\"没有转过身，\"格林...阿桃如今已经是樊笼之鸟了，你去追寻自由吧，不用在这里陪我。\""}
{"time": 1752518421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500791710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不值得你停留...\"继续开口，\"我的魔法留在你的笔记本上...黑色那本...记得吗？你拿上它和我的魔杖，离开吧。\""}
{"time": 1752518574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012713687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你说得对，但是协契断金。洞若观火。离火，天倾。刃随神至。侵分，灭形！心眼入神。征！丹煌行令。断！谁才是樊笼之鸟呢\n）"}
{"time": 1752518631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277408493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林摇头“我不会丢下你一个人的”"}
{"time": 1752518648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362996735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(谁才是樊笼之鸟呢)"}
{"time": 1752518670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1942638299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1277408493]\"...我没什么能教你。\""}
{"time": 1752518815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "605590215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我不管，我不在乎这个，你就是我师傅”"}
{"time": 1752518990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231616412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...阿桃是麻烦鬼...是害人精...很任性，又不在乎其他人...不要...不要跟着我啦...\"压抑的眼泪抑制不住，一滴一滴滴落到枕头上，话语的最后几乎哽咽地不成声"}
{"time": 1752519298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "360276516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好啦好啦，别哭了，我会一直陪在你身边的”格林轻柔地拍拍你"}
{"time": 1752519509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567649745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"......被弟子安慰什么的...\"眼泪更止不住了，\"呜呜呜...阿桃好难受...什么都做不到，没有自由...好委屈...\"转过身看着她，眼睛周围红肿了一片，眼眶盈满泪水，委屈巴巴的眼神，\"好难受。\""}
{"time": 1752519788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822310131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（唉，苦痛，如影随形）"}
{"time": 1752519991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701542104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“别这么说啦，领主对你也是有愧疚的，他可是请了附近最好的大夫给你治疗呢，现在师傅也能使用魔法了，教安琪也能更快了吧，等教学完以后，我们再一起去闯荡吧，我们要当一辈子的师徒啊”"}
{"time": 1752520100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027998643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\".....这次，过了多久?\""}
{"time": 1752520127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016395632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"魔法跳过了多久?昏迷了多久?\""}
{"time": 1752520227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723520233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“半天，据领主所说我们消失了半天，当天凌晨便两个人一起昏迷在门口，师傅伤势比较重，又过了两天才醒来”"}
{"time": 1752520341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2145429363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...格林，你听说过提丰吗？\""}
{"time": 1752520373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3681641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林摇头"}
{"time": 1752520473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740205247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样...\"叹口气，在床上躺好，\"我伤到什么地方了。\"现在还没掀开被子看"}
{"time": 1752520797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203629587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“腹部有严重刀伤，伴有火灼痕迹，不过经过处理应该不会留下太多的疤痕，还有就是全身毛细血管炸开，昏迷的第一天你整个人都是红色的，时不时还有肌肉痉挛，不过第二天便好了很多，这些症状都消散了，也许是大夫给的药很有效吧”"}
{"time": 1752520913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369175176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...这样我居然还活着吗？\"有点想象不到那种样子，叹口气，\"我的魔力衰减了。\""}
{"time": 1752520948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549452474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可能就是强行越过这个镯子的缘故....那个血管爆裂什么之类的..\""}
{"time": 1752520994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800861560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我就说怎么当时师傅突然能用次元魔法了”"}
{"time": 1752521012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196952517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“原来是这样”"}
{"time": 1752521114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654911273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"犹豫了一下最后没开口说提丰的事，\"那家伙是谁?有查到什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1752521327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941442424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不知道她的具体身份，只知道她一直在追杀某些人，这些人身份和背景没有什么共通的地方，感觉什么人都有，有传言说她是要干掉哪个家伙，不知道可信度如何”"}
{"time": 1752521415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773184530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看上去倒是很有可信度....也许我该改进一下次元魔法了，我们得去很早之前的时代看一看。\""}
{"time": 1752521417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388162474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“她这次出现斩杀了咱们这个领土的一个修道馆馆主”"}
{"time": 1752521537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401316898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这个馆主有什么特殊之处吗？\""}
{"time": 1752521754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314645996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好像也没有什么特别的地方……实力也不是很强，只是中等水平……呃，家里有个刚出生的孩子？”"}
{"time": 1752521828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661154694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不明白....阿桃现在也没心情玩侦探游戏。\""}
{"time": 1752521838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773719385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这段时间，格林不要出门。\""}
{"time": 1752521918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673378720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那家伙估计还在附近找我们，先躲起来吧。\""}
{"time": 1752521932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470093558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯……早知道我当时就不跑开了……也就不会发生这种事”"}
{"time": 1752522097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441509370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=470093558]\"...所以...当时为什么突然跑开了？\"紧抿着唇"}
{"time": 1752522174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435016384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“瞒了你这么久……还被你拆穿……很不好意思……”"}
{"time": 1752522292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688952893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呵...毕竟阿桃是，塔里的天才...\"对着格林伸出没有带手镯的那只手，\"格林...我突然也有些想念塔了...\""}
{"time": 1752522315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7108168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不知道阿桃的那些师兄师姐师弟师妹...还活着没有...\""}
{"time": 1752522420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925766717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林握住你的手“200年了，也许都已经去世了吧”"}
{"time": 1752522497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "254864913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“塔的通缉令是不见到尸体不撤回，这真是一个难评的规定”"}
{"time": 1752522523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408470246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"突然感觉...有些孤独呢...\"看着她，\"这种魔法...或许真的不应该研究出来，不过...阿桃就是忍不住嘛...更加自由..超越次元...就像阿桃一直做的梦。\""}
{"time": 1752522543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877973671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“现在居然还有着上古时代的追杀，怎么可能有人能活这么久嘛”"}
{"time": 1752522604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "529206820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟是塔，这种地方就是充满着死板的教条啦。\"握紧手心，\"我不也被追杀了两百年?\"想到这里突然有些想笑，\"明明我也...没有很厉害的魔力...\""}
{"time": 1752522749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509115865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“但是你会这个世界上最厉害的魔法”"}
{"time": 1752522817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984621347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"现在愿意承认了？\"终于露出了一些笑容，\"桃乐丝是天才的事情?\""}
{"time": 1752522948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1150477580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“谁能说不是呢”格林也笑了"}
{"time": 1752523051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1510702410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼哼...\"咳嗽两声，\"那我也只能勉为其难告诉格林，天才只是见我的门槛，而格林...恰好有这个资格啦。\""}
{"time": 1752523134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663511170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哈哈，那正是我的荣幸”"}
{"time": 1752523138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593412683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=4BC8D9B74714068C636998F0F8FF252C.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQqhcG_k63UolI5ERld7XlyRId4YhjsOSD_CijGnN24kb2OAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhAxKrYybAnIFkQ_GxtKFAMCegLysg&amp;rkey=CAESMF77LwB4vyVKapb57MlHn_4-bHcR-RBiV_EmT1eU1VZ376HrEIj505MXU2uKDgbnvw,file_size=7404]"}
{"time": 1752523211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051030928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好了...阿桃想休息了...格林...会陪着我吗？\""}
{"time": 1752523281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768720682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我会陪着你的，安心睡吧”"}
{"time": 1752523435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001935347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": ".log off"}
{"time": 1752523442, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1768848302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1752523446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631124573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（草）"}
{"time": 1752523461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055534966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你再发一次吧）"}
{"time": 1752523508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951517746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"紧握着手，闭上眼，不一会儿就安然入睡了。"}
{"time": 1752523511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225054202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1752765790, "type": "reply", "message_id": "680565861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1752765984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746992076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "之后的日子每天除了教学安琪魔术，剩下的时间用来钻研自己的大魔法，闲来无事也会观看格林练剑，但从来不跟吉诺说话，有时也会和自己的第二个弟子安琪开一些茶话会，跟她讲自己的见闻之类"}
{"time": 1752766854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168212255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1752766876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200305854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（别急）"}
{"time": 1752767136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301775332", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "每天过着这样平淡的日常，半年时间过去了，安琪已经学会了所有的低级魔术，开始慢慢摸索着向中级魔术跃进，进展还算可以，平时听你讲自己的见闻也听的津津有味，对你越发崇拜，也对外面的世界越发向往。格林没有再偷偷练剑，领主也乐得吉诺有自己的事可以做，而不是当他的护卫，也就让他们随意发挥，所以每天上下午都能看到两人在门口训练。格林的匕首之前断了，于是吉诺送了她一柄黑曜石剑，可是一开始格林死活不愿意收下，说是讨厌黑色，令得吉诺有点沮丧，最后他在剑刃和剑柄处分别用材料点缀了红色和绿色，格林才收下。后来你拿过这把剑来看，发现这剑的工艺不是一般的好，材料也是非常的贵，不由得咋舌。如今的格林经过训练，整个人看起来健康了好多，从文学少女变成了阳光女孩的感觉，不过听格林说现在的训练只能锻炼体魄和技术，真正的大杀招还得有斗气，也就是魔力才能施展，所以吉诺在发愁以后得怎么教她。吉诺这小子在这段时间和格林关系越来越亲密，你感觉他应该是对格林有意思，但是格林好像在恋爱方面比较的钝感，并没有注意到。"}
{"time": 1752767144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198771414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（不行）"}
{"time": 1752767148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620416184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（感觉得分段）"}
{"time": 1752767183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894830070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "每天过着这样平淡的日常，半年时间过去了，安琪已经学会了所有的低级魔术，开始慢慢摸索着向中级魔术跃进，进展还算可以，平时听你讲自己的见闻也听的津津有味，对你越发崇拜，也对外面的世界越发向往。"}
{"time": 1752767221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643184089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林没有再偷偷练剑，领主也乐得吉诺有自己的事可以做，而不是当他的护卫，也就让他们随意发挥，所以每天上下午都能看到两人在门口训练。格林的匕首之前断了，于是吉诺送了她一柄黑曜石剑，可是一开始格林死活不愿意收下，说是讨厌黑色，令得吉诺有点沮丧，最后他在剑刃和剑柄处分别用材料点缀了红色和绿色，格林才收下。后来你拿过这把剑来看，发现这剑的工艺不是一般的好，材料也是非常的贵，不由得咋舌。"}
{"time": 1752767246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224718567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "如今的格林经过训练，整个人看起来健康了好多，从文学少女变成了阳光女孩的感觉，不过听格林说现在的训练只能锻炼体魄和技术，真正的大杀招还得有斗气，也就是魔力才能施展，所以吉诺在发愁以后得怎么教她。吉诺这小子在这段时间和格林关系越来越亲密，你感觉他应该是对格林有意思，但是格林好像在恋爱方面比较的钝感，并没有注意到。"}
{"time": 1752767291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1992325828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（没说完）"}
{"time": 1752767298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452174349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1752767700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569492161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你在课余时间继续研究着你的次元魔法，好在有上一次在时空间隙中短暂停留的经历，你对时空的了解有了进一步的加深，只是要进一步的了解其中的机制的话，还需要更多的观察，只可惜平时使用次元魔法时都是直接穿过间隙，留存时间非常的短，这让你有点苦恼。让你感到有点无语的是，自己的魔力量经由上次的强行激发后，竟然再也无法增加，仿佛容器已经满了，你只好退而求其次，提纯自己魔力的质量，这比提升魔力量要难得多，毕竟提升魔力量是以单体魔力为单位，提纯魔力却是要操作全部的魔力，所以进展缓慢"}
{"time": 1752767764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930261955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "灵感检定，然后.ww7"}
