{"time": 1752859065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529238994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（不能自己找事做吗（）"}
{"time": 1752859092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199550356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "起床，照例直接去餐厅"}
{"time": 1752859226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076166495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你来到餐厅，领主正在看报纸，格林和吉诺大概吃完了去练剑了"}
{"time": 1752859333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366079763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "倒也没什么特别想说的话，安静地吃完早餐，今天打算去外面逛一逛"}
{"time": 1752859415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875854531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "只是突然想起了什么，开口“我的杖，领主先生”"}
{"time": 1752859532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321471323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "领主示意管家去取你的魔杖“今天要出门吗？”"}
{"time": 1752859642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518303455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“稍微出趟门，晚饭可以不用留了。”打个哈欠，站起身收拾一下着装，至于根本没打理完全翘起来的头发，就更懒得管了"}
{"time": 1752859725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334923743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“注意一下安全，最近有一些奇怪的人在搞特殊集会，说是宣扬什么‘神’的光辉”"}
{"time": 1752859771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561120522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "注：你的记忆里，这个世界不存在宗教信仰"}
{"time": 1752859784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418511798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“集会？神？那是什么？”皱着眉头"}
{"time": 1752859854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762095675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“谁知道呢，他们宣称他们的神可以赐予祝福，是至高存在”"}
{"time": 1752859883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892870059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“实际上是不是真正存在也不好说”"}
{"time": 1752859921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641231131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不过他们倒是有些手段，据情报说部分人施展出了非凡的能力”"}
{"time": 1752859958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015665716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“非凡的能力？”歪着脑袋，一只手垫着，“什么？”"}
{"time": 1752859961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527509343", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“魔法不就是了”"}
{"time": 1752859966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100212918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“魔法不就是吗？”"}
{"time": 1752860244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745797452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过没事吧，我只是想出去逛逛。也不会参与什么集会。\"站起身伸个懒腰"}
{"time": 1752860323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255365869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好像说是把手放上去就能治疗疾病，听说还有其他，这些魔法能做到吗？”"}
{"time": 1752860368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642693453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(治疗魔术?有吗)"}
{"time": 1752860382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403661089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（显然没有）"}
{"time": 1752860398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495183989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（不是和你说都是成属性的吗）"}
{"time": 1752860443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430506655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样，那我倒是有些好奇了，他们的集会地点在哪里?\""}
{"time": 1752860473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141967794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（这种世界观的治疗魔法和元素魔法都是不同体系的）"}
{"time": 1752860490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63576206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你可以理解成这个世界的治疗魔法刚开始出现吧）"}
{"time": 1752860501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320491215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（OK）"}
{"time": 1752860522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343087747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“啊呀，我的本意是，离那群人远点会比较安全”"}
{"time": 1752860554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181463793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这也算是研究啦，阿桃当然会去一趟的。”"}
{"time": 1752860633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818877425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"领主不如告诉我在哪里集会哦\""}
{"time": 1752860723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166091165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "起身，等等自己的杖送过来"}
{"time": 1752860735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459685258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“集会地点倒是不固定，不过他们在西边的那个山坡有一个小诊所”"}
{"time": 1752860855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390163508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“收到。”伸展一下四肢，倒是有段时间没动过了"}
{"time": 1752860941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338728468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“注意安全啊”"}
{"time": 1752861011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631541384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿上自己的魔杖，转身摆摆手，“没事啦。”，向外走"}
{"time": 1752861371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336684812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（直奔目的地！）"}
{"time": 1752861375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "720979540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1752861413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891830191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（路过庭院不是要先看见格林吗）"}
{"time": 1752861434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011160335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（那你但是说（）"}
{"time": 1752861506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648879768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "出门以后，你看见格林和吉诺在对打，不过大家都看得出是吉诺在下指导棋"}
{"time": 1752861558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601606819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿着魔杖稍微驻足看一会，过了一会摇摇头，准备施展飞行魔法离开"}
{"time": 1752861675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175713930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（过呗）"}
{"time": 1752861690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184282553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra魔法"}
{"time": 1752861690, "type": "reply", "message_id": "184282553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]进行技能[魔法:69]检定: 1D100=37 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1752861709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408568760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（完全没注意到吗）"}
{"time": 1752861713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75933663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那我跑了）"}
{"time": 1752861742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470905147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（太认真了）"}
{"time": 1752861776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862119676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那就故意把魔法腾空的动静弄大一点，jpg"}
{"time": 1752861806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247124785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "听到起飞的风声，格林才意识到你要出门了，朝你挥手“啊，师傅你要出门吗”"}
{"time": 1752861878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890029286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“稍微出趟远门咯，晚饭我已经让领主不留了。”"}
{"time": 1752861967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2103769779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯？”格林狐疑地看着你“要我和你一起去吗”"}
{"time": 1752861995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "912483271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“格林练剑这么认真，我哪会不解风情打扰你们呢”"}
{"time": 1752862082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645887502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1752862269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599998174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "意识到这句话有点奇怪，清清嗓子，“咳咳，我打算去看一看据说是神的信徒”"}
{"time": 1752862397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075184193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“神的信徒？那是什么？”"}
{"time": 1752862507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189320341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不清楚啦，不过说是全知全能的什么存在，很有趣不是吗？”戴上自己点缀着宝石的黑色尖帽子，气流吹起身后有些乱的头发"}
{"time": 1752862666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168394803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“欸～真的有这样的家伙吗”"}
{"time": 1752862830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125318794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不知道哦，所以阿桃现在就去看看。”眯着眼，嘴角挂着标志性的欠揍笑容"}
{"time": 1752862898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146195821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林眨眨眼，看向吉诺“今天的训练先暂停可以吗”"}
{"time": 1752862909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206196417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "吉诺苦笑“我可以说不行吗？”"}
{"time": 1752862919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600171147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不可以”格林回道"}
{"time": 1752862938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807142762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "吉诺无奈摊手🤷‍♂️"}
{"time": 1752863020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547070834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "好整以暇地看着，“诶？”"}
{"time": 1752863228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648273276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林这就一下跳上你的魔杖“那我走啦！”"}
{"time": 1752863342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195369788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯哼？那就出发咯？”催动魔力，腾空去往西方"}
{"time": 1752863386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143740777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“出发！”"}
{"time": 1752863486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103205949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "那么过了一段时间，你们到了目的地"}
{"time": 1752863520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769991741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "是一个不大不小的木屋"}
{"time": 1752863605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428373094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "悬浮在空中，看着眼前的木屋，暂时没有下去的打算，而是慢慢开口“格林，我有时在想...如果真的和不同时间的人建立很深的联系的话...到时候该怎么离开呢？”"}
{"time": 1752863878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374149622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“怎么能这么说呢，生活的本位就是和人建立联系，更何况有相逢就必有别离”"}
{"time": 1752863937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2076616901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“总不能为了不遇到伤心的别离，就一直逃下去吧”"}
{"time": 1752864028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153939115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“连阿桃都注意到了哦？”回过头看她，“格林就没有意识到吗？”"}
{"time": 1752864044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878198511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯？”"}
{"time": 1752864157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "735210607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "压低自己的帽檐遮住视线，“那家伙很明显喜欢上格林了吧”"}
{"time": 1752864206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702526065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哪个家伙？”格林望了望四周，没看见人"}
{"time": 1752864317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799486592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就是那谁，教你剑法那个啦。\"尽量用轻松的语气"}
{"time": 1752864372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137959153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“吉诺？怎么可能啦”格林笑了"}
{"time": 1752864415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802340971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“阿桃都能确认哦？”抬起帽檐，很认真的眼神看向她"}
{"time": 1752864448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022634405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“如果格林愿意留下来，那阿桃也不会勉强你的。”同样很认真的语气开口"}
{"time": 1752864515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852516346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“就凭你？”"}
{"time": 1752864519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287630849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你有男朋友吗”"}
{"time": 1752864572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858757766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是的，这是人类少女的直觉。\"竖起一根手指，\"精灵是不懂得啦\""}
{"time": 1752864648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905713596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“也许吧”"}
{"time": 1752864682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465485233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“退一万步，就算他真的喜欢我，他不跟我说是怎么个事”"}
{"time": 1752864706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643394502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这就是暗恋啦，我在塔里也见过的，芳心暗许，生怕对方拒绝。\"点点头"}
{"time": 1752864876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91885418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以嘛，如果格林愿意为他留下，我是不会无缘无故拆散有缘人的。\"摘掉帽子"}
{"time": 1752865023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184364470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这个嘛，到时候再说吧，八字没有一撇的事”"}
{"time": 1752865054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942922553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“而且我还是觉得那只是你的错觉”"}
{"time": 1752865082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553449233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“既然是暗恋，又怎么会被你看出来”"}
{"time": 1752865123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931354103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“暴露出来的恋情还能叫暗恋吗”"}
{"time": 1752865142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331770333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...只有格林没看出来啦。\"略有些伤感地看着，\"在这里分离吗...\""}
{"time": 1752865236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90512068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“退十万步讲，就算我跟他在一起了，为什么不是他跟着我们一起旅行”"}
{"time": 1752865275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322421004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说是暗恋，其实都很明显了吧？\"摇摇头，听完她最后一句话，很明显皱了皱眉，\"我不愿意。\""}
{"time": 1752865417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504671724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“欸？你还是这么讨厌他吗”"}
{"time": 1752865564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379572409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"从来没喜欢过，没有骂过他只是因为他在教你。\"无情感的无起伏声线，说完小声跟了一句，\"无论是作为师傅还是别的层面。\""}
{"time": 1752865666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1040705989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“所以说你就是这点不行啦”格林笑着用手指戳戳你的脸"}
{"time": 1752865717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720015478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶？我怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1752888650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "646469696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": ".log off"}
{"time": 1752950692, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2134081982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1752950742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782422643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1720015478]“没～什么”"}
{"time": 1752950955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796928418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"格林又是这样，话不说完。\"生气地鼓着脸不让她戳，\"哼..\""}
{"time": 1752951139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665223920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嘿嘿～”"}
{"time": 1752951341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625865760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以说有没有认真考虑我的话啦。\""}
{"time": 1752951518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513315535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“精灵寿命很长，像这种程度的离别，很常见的啦”"}
{"time": 1752951537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003839987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（哇，是寿命论）"}
{"time": 1752951573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949548265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眨眨眼睛，\"那我呢？\"指着自己，\"我也快十九岁了哦，最多还能活五十年吧。\""}
{"time": 1752951581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930034888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就不的不问了)"}
{"time": 1752951648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "57873713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“只能活70岁的人类是不是身体有点弱了……”"}
{"time": 1752951772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353816674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?像阿桃这样的，活七十都是高寿了吧。\""}
{"time": 1752951799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145114744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说不定哪天就死在什么地方了，自然死亡已经是很不错啦。\""}
{"time": 1752951883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840907375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“所以你不能一个人乱跑啊”"}
{"time": 1752951896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091266654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“至今为止多少次了都”"}
{"time": 1752951929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760044067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“感觉我不跟着你你的寿命会缩短三倍”"}
{"time": 1752952040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440038805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"干嘛啦，反正上限摆在那里吧。\""}
{"time": 1752952066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330090930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "手指比一个短短的距离，\"再努力阿桃也只能活这么久的话，想更精彩一些啊。\""}
{"time": 1752952132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263735477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“一直精彩到寿终正寝不就好了”"}
{"time": 1752952273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908612863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?所以格林才十六岁，就已经想着阿桃死的事了吗？\""}
{"time": 1752952309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526928394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你这丫头是不是欠教训了。\""}
{"time": 1752952356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534593186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“略略略，有本事和我来一场不用魔法的御前决斗啊”"}
{"time": 1752952459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356657579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...嘶，我记得当初阿桃说要锻炼身体的时候，某人把我拦下来了\""}
{"time": 1752952486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090107253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不会就是为了这种事吧？\"瞪她"}
{"time": 1752952542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190021034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嘿嘿”她做了一个可爱的表情"}
{"time": 1752952681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793680190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，好啦。\"降落到小屋旁"}
{"time": 1752952743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230358701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谈寿命什么的未免有些伤感，和你们精灵更是聊不来。\"拿好魔杖，走上前敲门"}
{"time": 1752953043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732817054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "门没关，被你一敲便向一边滑去，里面的景象一览无余。眼前是一个大的客厅，一个木桌上摆着许多水果，壁炉旁坐着一个白裙少女，正在打着瞌睡，嘴角流出闪光的液体"}
{"time": 1752953058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573002653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=A1CB945D5FC93957EAC24B26E4392D4A.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQfXK9iGgMFTBf7kmO9pblB_iX7tBjU4C8g_woo_66-gtPJjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQbCwU5qUWEznst5dh8aQpn3oCK7E&amp;rkey=CAISMLjiPcvsWOXsc3L1hocGZeIGroubpPEFGDexbdSbLj6aQdUBXylkpfAUD9lCPaj0Jw,file_size=782420]"}
{"time": 1752953063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634534034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（1）"}
{"time": 1752953124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749921755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1752953155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "320690163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...我原以为会是更有冲击力的画面呢\""}
{"time": 1752953173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041940912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "站在门口礼貌地敲敲门，尝试让她醒过来"}
{"time": 1752953353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "15339012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“呜……啊，你们好啊”擦了擦口水，她的脸上露出温和的笑容"}
{"time": 1752953498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203771492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我听闻这里宣扬神的存在。\"也对着她露出温和的笑，\"特意来看看。\""}
{"time": 1752953503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787117098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可以进屋吗？\""}
{"time": 1752953699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413687287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“诶多，这个时候要说……”她偷偷翻出来一张小纸条“请进，神永远会给众生敞开大门”"}
{"time": 1752953789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392651881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?\"拉着格林走进屋，\"为什么会觉得有神这种存在呢，\"笑容满面"}
{"time": 1752953934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689619835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "她又看了眼纸条“神一直都在，祂关注世人，只可惜世人无法认知祂的存在，这就是我等信徒存在的必要”"}
{"time": 1752953959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463345928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?那敢问有没有存在证明?\""}
{"time": 1752953977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401301070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"神迹啦，神恩啦。\"手指卷卷头发"}
{"time": 1752954063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138895665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "这次倒是没看纸条“有的哦！梅露露就得到神恩了”"}
{"time": 1752954141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038141226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?在哪里呢？阿桃怎么没看见?\""}
{"time": 1752954224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584728948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“梅露露可以给人治病”她羞涩地摸了摸头发"}
{"time": 1752954301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "13479917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...很有建设性...\"走上前，\"先来查查我身上的病?\""}
{"time": 1752954381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1967954066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不是，我自己是看不出来是什么病啦”"}
{"time": 1752954399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951072654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“只是如果有病，那就可以治”"}
{"time": 1752954436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1977630695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "仔细思考自己有没有病，干脆把手伸出来，\"那你治一治这个手镯吧。\""}
{"time": 1752954447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357883343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这玩意就是我的病根\""}
{"time": 1752954505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741171432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“诶？”梅露露有点困惑"}
{"time": 1752954528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373766235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林在旁边捂嘴笑"}
{"time": 1752954564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118784121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总之试试吧，我来见识一下。\""}
{"time": 1752954719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415017778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我还……没有试过给人以外的东西……”话虽如此，她还是双手盖在你的手镯上，嘴中小声念着什么"}
{"time": 1752954776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365524524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "仔细观察"}
{"time": 1752954823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "715828593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（观察什么）"}
{"time": 1752954866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29597705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这个神恩到底本质是什么这件事)"}
{"time": 1752955057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246972917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你感觉有魔力从她手中灌注到体内，在周围环绕了几圈后便退回了她手中"}
{"time": 1752955099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "618223087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好像手镯无法治疗呢，不过我帮您看了身体，应该没有要治的病”"}
{"time": 1752955133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708405813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"魔力吗？\""}
{"time": 1752955148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "346379418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "轻声，把格林拉过来，\"请您给她也看看吧\""}
{"time": 1752955358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855245317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（思考）"}
{"time": 1752955402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778893861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯”她也把双手叠在格林手中，不久后开口道“好啦，治好了”"}
{"time": 1752955458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990370429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"治好了?\""}
{"time": 1752955480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456652437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把一只手放在格林手上，感受魔力"}
{"time": 1752955494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023768271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "并没有魔力"}
{"time": 1752955631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1849691263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（小困）"}
{"time": 1752955644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3812104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"到底治好了啥啊...\""}
{"time": 1752955647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186813790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就睡)"}
{"time": 1752955653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095878237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=E44D17DAA27F9DF2B564CE1B64C3AE1A.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRl1nZ1n1DyHyZO1tlD9ouMmbqcMRiQ-AQg_woovf6B2NzJjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQwurVsG8sQyhHxkeZK_IRZXoCAT0&amp;rkey=CAISMLjiPcvsWOXsc3L1hocGZeIGroubpPEFGDexbdSbLj6aQdUBXylkpfAUD9lCPaj0Jw,file_size=80912]"}
{"time": 1752955688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381413431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好像，胳膊和大腿没那么酸了”格林说道"}
{"time": 1752955720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065784457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说是神迹，其实是魔法啊。\""}
{"time": 1752955743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970666063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...这个魔法能教教我吗？\""}
{"time": 1752981987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1241988095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“抱歉，其实我也不知道怎么教人”梅露露腼腆地笑笑"}
{"time": 1752982037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "827605403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不过要是信仰神，沐浴在祂的光辉之下，终有一天你也能得到神恩的”"}
{"time": 1752987742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242941004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以说啦，真的存在吗？\"皱着眉，\"不会是被人特意编出来，用这种魔法拉拢信徒扩展自己势力吧？\""}
{"time": 1752987991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132080277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“怎么能这么说呢！神是肯定存在的！”梅露露有点生气"}
{"time": 1752988122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280269788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"一个魔法不能证明啦，有没有更有决定性的证据?\"不为所动，\"虽然开创这种魔法确实很有水平，但全知全能，不现实吧？\""}
{"time": 1752988551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751322595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "她又拿出纸条看看“对那些用能力强行辩驳神不存在的人这么说……哦不对，说错了……神的权能并非我等凡人所能揣度，神爱世人，所以将神力下放到世间，我们应该心怀感激，而不是贪得无厌地要求更多”"}
{"time": 1752988804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610646316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...你自己都不能确定吧？\"满脸黑线，\"纸条上的内容是谁教你的?\""}
{"time": 1752988995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165779202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "梅露露羞涩笑笑，用手指缠了缠垂下的发丝“不对哦，我确信神是一定存在的，只不过我嘴笨，所以主教才给我一张纸条帮我”"}
{"time": 1752989146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911795932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以说搞不懂你们的信仰之类的东西了，无法证明的东西吧？\"扫一圈室内，\"那么，你们的主教人呢\""}
{"time": 1752989296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527785840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "看纸条“诡辩者总是以无法证明来质疑我们的信仰，不要理会他们……哦这是写给我看的”"}
{"time": 1752989309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106235480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“主教平日不在这里哦”"}
{"time": 1752989359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280305642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摊摊手，\"他什么时候会过来?\""}
{"time": 1752989823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545969507", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不知道，他只是偶尔来这边，毕竟我这里只是给镇民们治病，偶尔传教，主教他们才是忙着”"}
{"time": 1752989839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989558673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不知道，他只是偶尔来这边，毕竟我这里只是给镇民们治病，偶尔传教，主教他们才是传教的核心”"}
{"time": 1752989963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371751497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样，看来和他们对话更有哲学意义一些啊...\"看向她，\"你是因为什么决定信仰神的。\""}
{"time": 1752990740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547294394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“在我妈妈重病的时候，主教找到了我，让我能够获得神的恩赐，治好我的母亲，还能治好众多百姓。神爱世人，这就是我信仰祂的理由”"}
{"time": 1752991036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995169230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果从做的事情来看....倒是...符合仁慈的定位，不过还在初期..有待观察。\""}
{"time": 1752991077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265800931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧，那我就不说什么你们信仰的神的坏话了。这个魔法，是他们教你的吗？\""}
{"time": 1752991654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539363466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不是啊，我不是说过嘛，是神赐予我的力量”"}
{"time": 1752991673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129601316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有点意思...那神也能赐予我力量吗？\""}
{"time": 1752991882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1886543095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“主教说只有心诚之人才能得到恩赐”"}
{"time": 1752991957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743999437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...也就是说，梅露露亲是在信仰了祂之后，突然就拥有了治愈的能力?\""}
{"time": 1752992044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777733372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是方便啊...只需要虔诚就能变强，显得我们这些钻研这钻研那的魔法师有些一文不值了。\"打趣的语气"}
{"time": 1752992143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035369065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“能说是突然吗？应该算吧？……记得接受洗礼过后，那天晚上我好像做了一个梦，梦的内容记不清了，醒来就知道自己能够治疗他人了”"}
{"time": 1752992179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366864592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"洗礼，给阿桃也试试吧？\""}
{"time": 1752992210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850869430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“得找主教啦，负责洗礼的是主教”"}
{"time": 1752992267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2078971244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶诶，梅露露亲也不知道主教什么时候来对不对，对了。一拍手\""}
{"time": 1752992278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329676794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你们信的那个神，叫什么?\""}
{"time": 1752992454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520406662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“神就是神，没有名字啦，或者说，神就是祂的名字”"}
{"time": 1752992632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808307788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是....行吧\""}
{"time": 1752992652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059817624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以你在这里，做什么?一个人吗\""}
{"time": 1752992742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112871925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“在等人来，偶尔会有需要治病的人前来寻求帮助”"}
{"time": 1752992750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379214695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“姑且只有我一个人啦”"}
{"time": 1752992833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938539185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我说，既然是等人来的话，为什么不搬到城里?\""}
{"time": 1752993495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791752507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（在隔壁群骂江南骂爽了）"}
{"time": 1752993546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496606600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(ok)"}
{"time": 1752993612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702903977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这里离城里也不算太远，没差吧”"}
{"time": 1752993844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527033889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“阿桃倒是预感，你们这个信仰可能会单独发展得很空前哦。”思考，“我是不是应该参上一支原始股呢”"}
{"time": 1752994232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872075032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“话说回来，我还没有问过你们两人的姓名呢”"}
{"time": 1752994507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649940797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“本小姐是桃乐丝哦，天才的大魔女。”戴上帽子，摆个半遮眼的cos"}
{"time": 1752994534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1559671081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这位则是。”拍了拍格林"}
{"time": 1752994544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581223704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“本魔女座下大弟子”"}
{"time": 1752994660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318924142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林也摆了个pose“嗨嗨，一点不会魔法的老子登场！”"}
{"time": 1752994684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123563053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“诶？”梅露露有点傻眼"}
{"time": 1752994946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634693418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“咳咳，这是格林啦。”把她拉到自己身后"}
{"time": 1752994972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566593853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“所以说，我能不能参与一下原始股？”"}
{"time": 1752995036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292914499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“是要怎么样啦？”"}
{"time": 1752995210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390561339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“就是，我会帮你们传教，怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1752995228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913341777", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“作为报酬，我要在你们教中享有一定第五哦”"}
{"time": 1752995235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001186066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“作为报酬，我要在你们教中享有一定地位哦”"}
{"time": 1752995280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396552315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "梅露露小退后一步“感觉像是某种大坏蛋说出来的话”"}
{"time": 1752995323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "372971062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶？很公平吧，真是的，被说是坏人我也会很伤心的。”"}
{"time": 1752995364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352983682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嘛，总之就是这么回事啦。”摘下帽子露出明媚的笑容，“因为我很看好你们和你们的神祇”"}
{"time": 1752995432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696725266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我觉得以权利为目的就已经偏离了我们的初衷啦”她坚毅地看向你“所以容我拒绝”"}
{"time": 1752995773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812699474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶诶...真是的，但是但凡是宗教，总免不了与世俗同流。\""}
{"time": 1752996155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419345965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "梅露露摇摇头，又看了眼纸条“神不会斥责世人想法的多样，但是那样的人注定无法获得神的垂青”"}
{"time": 1752996422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322662990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样么....\"露出思考的神色，\"如果是这样，倒是能保证本身的纯洁。\""}
{"time": 1752996458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "444469273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那样的话，我的话似乎有些不妥，我向你道歉。\""}
{"time": 1752996475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704548484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是，我依然想和主教见一面\""}
{"time": 1752996652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515606305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"梅露露亲，不知阿桃有没有这个资格\""}
{"time": 1752996932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "798790360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "梅露露皱眉“那你可不能再说刚才那种话”"}
{"time": 1752996976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960886356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好的嘛，刚刚那些话只是想试试，你们教会的信仰有没有真的让我觉得虔诚\""}
{"time": 1752997028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130670819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“但是很失礼啊”格林在旁边吐槽"}
{"time": 1752997041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "936740019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "梅露露也点头表示赞同"}
{"time": 1752997067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473867887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶？有这么失礼吗？这些都是阿桃从话本里学到的。”"}
{"time": 1752997213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697399063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“如果有人跟你说‘你学的魔法全都是错的！’，你也会觉得不开心吧”格林像教训小孩的口吻一样说道"}
{"time": 1752997467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057972258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好吧。”耷拉着脑袋，“阿桃这次错了啦。”"}
{"time": 1752997571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1886491719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不过我倒是真的很好奇，这种治疗的魔法，可不可以后天习得，好有趣，梅露露亲，你再展示一下吧。”点点头"}
{"time": 1752997953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339193342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“没有病的话，起不了效果啦”"}
{"time": 1752997997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079021953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嘛，不需要效果啦。我只想看看魔力是怎么运作的。”伸出手"}
{"time": 1752998160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608874949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "梅露露只好又把双手放在你的手上，和上次一样，你感觉有股魔力进入了你的身体，环绕了一圈，又退了出去"}
{"time": 1752998226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647291399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "接触的瞬间感受她体内魔力的流动"}
{"time": 1752998228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509574480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“怎……怎样？”"}
{"time": 1752998267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130011740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看能不能解析魔力的形成"}
{"time": 1752998273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2049312716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "魔法的缘由之类的"}
{"time": 1752998277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "721252884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你要感知的话就要让魔力流进她体内哦）"}
{"time": 1752998305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "426413741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唔...再试一次吧，这次我会流动一些魔力到你的手中。”"}
{"time": 1752998580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31948771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯……也行吧”她犹豫了一下开口，随后又再次施展治疗魔法"}
{"time": 1752998658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770037201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "流动魔力到她体内"}
{"time": 1752998712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215582961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你可以过一个"}
{"time": 1752998714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261439837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "魔法"}
{"time": 1752998724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365901608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra魔法"}
{"time": 1752998724, "type": "reply", "message_id": "365901608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]进行技能[魔法:69]检定: 1D100=90 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1752998748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692749747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...我的魔力有些紊乱，不好意思。”"}
{"time": 1752998779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116236309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你只感觉她的魔力温和而包容，没有解析出什么原理"}
{"time": 1752998785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326628357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=7A041B56E65857137896C38077833550.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQS8niuT_HMKq4qddJ_MfZFf6FhOBinXyD_CiihoYav_cqOAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhC_K5A3V4-D6qicxB6H-iGRegKPUg&amp;rkey=CAQSMHaCcE49CZSeun4VVV5sGofRLCIEqqBPohYg8TLx6QA6twmWncjrKGAQYVvjiYYVzA,file_size=12199]"}
{"time": 1752998829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485805006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...再试一次，拜托”"}
{"time": 1752998898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "586316389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（过的就是解析的检定）"}
{"time": 1752998989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "576696752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "再试了一次，你还是没有抓住什么头绪"}
{"time": 1752999035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132768528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“....有些查不出来”"}
{"time": 1752999101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600572594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我的魔力上次事情之后衰竭了很多。”叹口气"}
{"time": 1752999234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045625488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“没关系啦”格林安慰你"}
{"time": 1752999455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270793538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“但我确信是一种魔法哦？而且后天可以学习。”"}
{"time": 1752999541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446931839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我不太懂啦”梅露露说"}
{"time": 1752999838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125257079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“没关系，哼哼。”把巫师塔的徽章留在她手上"}
{"time": 1752999908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519848047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“主教来了之后，请梅露露亲给他看看这个，如果他愿意的话，就在这件屋子的窗头挂上红布，到时候我会欣然赴约。”"}
{"time": 1753000021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309730647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯，我会的”梅露露收下你给的徽章仔细端详"}
{"time": 1753000120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858438974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“巫师塔的徽章。”摆摆手，“下次再见咯？”"}
{"time": 1753000229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143497236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（虽然但是，名字是塔，或者七人塔）"}
{"time": 1753000234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934580246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（不过无所谓）"}
{"time": 1753000242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482628152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那就下次见”"}
{"time": 1753000300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1440736448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"拜拜。\"转身走出屋子，举起手伸个懒腰，\"天气不错，格林想去哪里转转?\""}
{"time": 1753000312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617902621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": ".log off"}
{"time": 1753037161, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1978996966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1753037305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327981128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“虽然说我们让梅露露帮忙引荐主教”"}
{"time": 1753037321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357013889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“到我们也可以自己去找不是吗？”"}
{"time": 1753037341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1543743570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“毕竟主教应该就是在城里传教吧”"}
{"time": 1753037354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442522673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好麻烦啊，而且我把塔的标记给她了。\""}
{"time": 1753037383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593242625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过...也许真的可以去城里看看，我刚刚说的话也不全是试探。\""}
{"time": 1753037394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271317142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“就算不找主教，或许也能遇到其他像梅露露那样的人”"}
{"time": 1753037440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980455256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这种教会什么的，总是世俗遮掩权柄的武器。\"手指卷着头发，反正本来也没打理，乱得不行，\"这个女孩太虔诚了说\""}
{"time": 1753037506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021563006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嘿，阴谋论者来啦”"}
{"time": 1753037625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658534421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"干嘛吗？合理的怀疑哦。\"随手扫两下头发，\"格林啊，以后能不能早上给阿桃整理整理头发。\""}
{"time": 1753037643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470929163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这几个月都没打理过，感觉长了好多。\""}
{"time": 1753037711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "213387246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不行，又不是小孩子”她帮你顺了顺头发“不过偶尔还是可以的”"}
{"time": 1753037772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622805840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"之前明明还在肩膀的，现在都快长到腰了。\"期待地看着她，\"我自己实在不好弄吗\""}
{"time": 1753037792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929059808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"格林也不想师傅就这么乱蓬蓬地走在大庭广众之下吧。\""}
{"time": 1753037927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1232047259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“诶……但是好麻烦”"}
{"time": 1753037942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840681415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你每天起的这么晚”"}
{"time": 1753037990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60445210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"抿着嘴唇，\"自然作息，怎么了嘛。\""}
{"time": 1753038035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181615409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“作为师傅，怎么能没有弟子勤奋”"}
{"time": 1753038037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099463282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉...我以后会早起的。\"突然想起了什么，\"格林还好意思说我，之前那会，天天睡到日上三竿，还是阿桃来喊你。\""}
{"time": 1753038080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096951358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那是因为晚上睡得晚嘛”"}
{"time": 1753038100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1027836307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼哼，要是师傅比弟子勤奋，那为什么要收弟子?\""}
{"time": 1753038131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594959690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸手点点她的鼻尖，\"所以格林记得每天来帮我，喊我起床也可以啦。\""}
{"time": 1753038165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060336941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“所以我觉得我掉进了这个世界上最大的陷阱”格林笑嘻嘻"}
{"time": 1753038253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64162374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼。\"扬起脑袋，\"那你还这么开心?\""}
{"time": 1753038349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133898938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“没办法啊，事已至此只能认命了”你的耳边传来一声夸张的叹息"}
{"time": 1753038392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749274136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"阿桃是世界上最麻烦，最会无理取闹的师傅。\"深以为然地点点头，随后拉着她跳上法杖腾空飞去城镇，\"格林呢，是最不尊重师傅的弟子，所以说...\""}
{"time": 1753038456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "575651928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "戛然停住，揉揉自己的脸盖住微微上涌的红晕，\"待会找到主教的话，先暗中观察一下\""}
{"time": 1753038531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329623915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好好，收到”"}
{"time": 1753038631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330831928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "微微呼出口气，戴上自己的帽子，\"等这个手镯解下来那天阿桃一定要大闹一番。\""}
{"time": 1753038714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135434581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "那么你和格林骑着法杖来到了镇子上"}
{"time": 1753038760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "15000836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在里面找找宗教人员的踪迹"}
{"time": 1753038796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666287876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "去哪里找呢"}
{"time": 1753038824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744609506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "这个小镇的布局和之前那个小镇大差不差"}
{"time": 1753038837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266366528", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "房屋都是环形分部"}
{"time": 1753038846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577347363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "房屋都是环形分布"}
{"time": 1753038858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67266095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "广场"}
{"time": 1753038874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471590501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这么想着，去广场那边看看有没有激情的布道人"}
{"time": 1753039024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850869358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "可惜的是你并没有看到有这样的人"}
{"time": 1753039046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225220732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"似乎没有呢...\""}
{"time": 1753039091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524629510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过来都来了。\"伸个懒腰，拉着格林去这边的甜品店，\"上次来跑得真快，这次不让你跑了。\"抓得很紧"}
{"time": 1753039124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684419450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好好好”"}
{"time": 1753039226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218188293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "坐在店里要两杯热可可，几碟小蛋糕，用勺子搅着杯子，\"嗯....说起来，不知不觉都驻足快一年了。\""}
{"time": 1753039239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144793096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“七个月吧”"}
{"time": 1753039250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1542276899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“离一年还远哦”"}
{"time": 1753039275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876439819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"差不多啦，我们来的时候是什么季节?\""}
{"time": 1753039379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768174140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想起被抓的事，\"说到底之所以被抓，全都是因为塔里面的老家伙不准研究魔法，要是有什么气化形体，隐形，藏踪，迷踪步啦，怎么可能会被抓嘛。\"越想越气，\"该研究研究这些了。\""}
{"time": 1753039431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276804193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“怎么会有这样的魔法啦”"}
{"time": 1753039527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919223436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么不会有?\"笑着看向她，\"这些都是基础魔法吧。\""}
{"time": 1753039587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899408191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"和我的比起来。\"拿起勺子挥一挥，\"要不是被塔里的家伙限制，这么多年，这些东西早就该研究出来了。不过...治疗，这种魔法的原理是什么呢？真有意思\""}
{"time": 1753039593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215655707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“基础在哪？这些都无法纳入属性魔法的体系吧”"}
{"time": 1753039682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131291040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"阿桃连时空都可以超越，属性魔法这种老掉牙的垃圾早该扫进垃圾堆了。\"得意地笑，\"凭这种体系，怎么解释我的魔法，治疗的魔法?\""}
{"time": 1753039721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811011414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“也许只是没有发掘出来的属性起了作用”"}
{"time": 1753039753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1052939955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"或许有人精通属性，元素啦，不过不重要，或许手什么未发现的属性吧，也不重要。\"看向窗外"}
{"time": 1753039800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84154788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"现有的体系完全无法解释，对不对?只凭那么几种东西就想定义这世界，所以说，那群自称贤者的家伙都是个顶个的蠢蛋。\""}
{"time": 1753039850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458756286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是为了自己的地位不被影响就好的，自私自利的废物罢了。\"拿起杯子优雅地抿一口，立刻放下，\"呃...烫烫烫。\"吐着舌头"}
{"time": 1753040031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561449756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“至少我们可以自己研究”"}
{"time": 1753040052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534537120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“反正咱们已经被通缉了”"}
{"time": 1753040087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772804884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"对...对的..\"舌头被烫到，说话有些哆嗦"}
{"time": 1753040124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195827817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "缓了一会，\"虽然我现在在尽力完善次元魔法啦，不过没什么进展呢。\"笑"}
{"time": 1753040168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937128498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“从0到1永远是最困难的啦”"}
{"time": 1753040185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283317736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我在想，要不要试一试隐形啦，感觉...用光暗的话，挺容易实现?\"摩挲着下巴，\"治疗魔法也许是一种生命能量也说不定?\""}
{"time": 1753040227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118139164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"似乎说的有些跳跃，不过桃乐丝不太擅长光暗的魔法，嗯...我的话...\""}
{"time": 1753040238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112660384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(能掌握什么层次的他系魔法呢)"}
{"time": 1753040281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633082746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（初级的倒是都会，中级及以上用起来就比较吃力了）"}
{"time": 1753040306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045848287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（初级魔法加大威力等同于中高级）"}
{"time": 1753040332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514604265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"要实现隐形在视觉中精细的光影变化的话...虽然有些麻烦，但似乎也是可以做到。\""}
{"time": 1753040357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152540807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“诶～”"}
{"time": 1753040393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715476305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"威力的话，我就做不到那么厉害的啦。\"思考，\"幸好，这似乎是障眼法，只考较魔力控制?\""}
{"time": 1753040485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790474417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"难点只是两系融合啦。\"突然笑起来，看着格林，\"和某人做过的全系融合毁天灭地的梦比起来，还是很容易的吧？\""}
{"time": 1753040503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379827737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟，阿桃可是用过水雷两系融合哦。\""}
{"time": 1753040522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140260401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哎呀，我那个还是理论状态嘛”"}
{"time": 1753040683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329343005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼哼，在你理论做梦的时候，我已经做出水雷球的尝试了，甚至还抽空研究了研究次元魔法，怎么样怎么样?是不是该夸夸阿桃\""}
{"time": 1753040716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330358555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "得意地扬起脑袋，帽子滑到后脑勺被头发卡住"}
{"time": 1753068551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118650769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你的头发到底多乱）"}
{"time": 1753068559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345349753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（还能把帽子卡住）"}
{"time": 1753068646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571713972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“厉害”"}
{"time": 1753068911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233985525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(又长又乱是这样啦)"}
{"time": 1753068936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933148860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（能乱成这样也是太抽象了）"}
{"time": 1753068966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675335365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=A5DCD3EC8063B61D3ED3886BE1501CA9.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT2EvrUBTQuhzmbd_E6goRwRucpmRjvzRIg_woo3LfE54LNjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQi9KhQuuSWAzgf-1HgNzpk3oCtXo&amp;rkey=CAESMNXFbE8A5VHXWghf7Rjl2uGW25gio2BJVN5PeIzUN1ORSUdehD51myZxi79KWo14kg,file_size=304879]"}
{"time": 1753068968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587631857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还行吧)"}
{"time": 1753068975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300708247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一向如此，jpg)"}
{"time": 1753069051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583546905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好没诚意的夸奖。\"把帽子取下来放在桌边，\"明明很厉害吧？\""}
{"time": 1753069145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1476944428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好厉害！”"}
{"time": 1753069483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493339622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"行吧。\"郁闷地看着窗外，\"不过隐身的话...还要配合消除脚步声的魔法吧。\""}
{"time": 1753079375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171549309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": ".log off"}
