{"time": 1753173704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148612140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你和格林回到了城堡里，领主正和吉诺在客厅闲聊，见你们回来，领主问你有什么发现"}
{"time": 1753178754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044172933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1753178758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065555011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(醒了)"}
{"time": 1753178860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014136302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"很有潜力的教会组织，我很感兴趣，也许后续会介入其中。\"组织着语言，\"不过，近期我要进行一些新魔法的实验工作。院子能借我用用吗？\""}
{"time": 1753182293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262789336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“什么魔法？”"}
{"time": 1753182427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540919357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"略有些破坏力。\"打个哈欠，\"气体压缩与维持之类的。\""}
{"time": 1753182474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515231091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"安琪也有风属性的天赋，她愿意可以和我一起。\""}
{"time": 1753182546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663843505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯……破坏力会有多大”"}
{"time": 1753182604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46145815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这个嘛...要是失控的话，轻则重伤吧。\""}
{"time": 1753182732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173980412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“……？”领主一脸黑线"}
{"time": 1753182799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062327613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟是将周围的气体无限趋向于0，却要用魔力维持其他地方的压强不变的魔法。\""}
{"time": 1753183441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098587095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以说我才会特意要一片院子，伤到其他人就不好了。\"停顿了一下，\"安琪的属性和我并不是全部重叠，火和土这方面，我只能带她打好基础，中阶及以上的话，我不会贸然教学。\""}
{"time": 1753184192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680137495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“行吧，你注意点不要伤到我宝贝女儿就是”"}
{"time": 1753184357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "569541035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "翻个白眼，\"那你就不要让她在我研究这个魔法的时候待在我旁边不就好了。\""}
{"time": 1753184933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483892128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=515231091]（你不是说一起吗（）"}
{"time": 1753184986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73159270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(愿意)"}
{"time": 1753184995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859524765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也没要求一起吧)"}
{"time": 1753185263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383261871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你是老师，你安排便是”"}
{"time": 1753185302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773079006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那个什么教会需要我这边出人手帮你吗？”"}
{"time": 1753185370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261276057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我觉得很有趣，之后也会和那边接触一番的。对了。\"伸出手，\"注意一下西边那个房子，如果，让人看着一点，有一天看见挂着一个红布，通知我一下就好。\""}
{"time": 1753185464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972189971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"格林，走啦，帮我弄头发。\""}
{"time": 1753186512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958302567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“唉，你就不能自己搞……”格林把你带进房间"}
{"time": 1753186624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351942087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?这可是格林答应的。\""}
{"time": 1753186665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760134722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我的头发这么长，可以弄出很好看的发型吧？\""}
{"time": 1753186750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495268532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林露出不怀好意的笑“肯定可以”"}
{"time": 1753186875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "967673851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"干嘛？\"缩着脑袋看着她，\"别整出什么奇怪的东西哦，我警告你。\""}
{"time": 1753187064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121665641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“怎么会～呢，包～好看的”"}
{"time": 1753187133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931067558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...哼...\""}
{"time": 1753187310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600585357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "然后格林就在你的身后捣鼓你的头发"}
{"time": 1753187360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041950627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "靠着椅子，闭着眼，因为今天消耗的魔力轻微休息一下"}
{"time": 1753187829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034112783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好了，结束了”你感受到头发被分成两束垂在耳边，同时用发圈固定以免散开"}
