{"time": 1753265639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031551802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "升起魔杖离开，往西边的屋子飞去"}
{"time": 1753265983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858494054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "还是那间小木屋，房门还是没关"}
{"time": 1753266272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019067347", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "径直走进去，\"日安，桃乐丝来了。\""}
{"time": 1753266284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793741910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "径直走进去，\"日安，桃乐丝应邀来了。\""}
{"time": 1753266664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088871999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "里面梅露露正和一个满脸胡子看起来就很睿智的中年人聊天"}
{"time": 1753266699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593038451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“桃乐丝小姐！这么快就来了”梅露露惊喜道"}
{"time": 1753266718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482324002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“介绍一下，这位是主教大人，这位是桃乐丝小姐”"}
{"time": 1753266729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302043180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有在注意这边的红布升起来了，于是立刻就赶了过来。\""}
{"time": 1753266754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560823468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"初次见面，祝您安康。主教先生。\""}
{"time": 1753266769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476540462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "提起裙摆微微行礼"}
{"time": 1753266833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830572183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你好，桃乐丝小姐”"}
{"time": 1753266842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314608794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "主教向你致意"}
{"time": 1753267101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941509302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"想必来此的原因梅露露亲已经跟您提过，你也邀请了我过来。\""}
{"time": 1753267155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703069736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我果然还是很好奇，这究竟是不是神迹，还是单纯的治愈魔法。\"问完话，\"唔...塔的徽章能还给我吗？\""}
{"time": 1753268923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400676610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "梅露露把徽章还给了你"}
{"time": 1753269012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685512860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "主教边捋着胡子边回答道“当然是神的恩赐，不过具体的体现形式，倒是和你说的一样”"}
{"time": 1753269044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751528085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“治愈魔法………塔里是有相关的记载？”"}
{"time": 1753269192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703008778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"从未有过，这种魔法和现存的属性魔法有些无法兼容。\"很正经地开口，\"所以我很好奇，并猜测这是属性为正能量，生命力的魔法。\""}
{"time": 1753269228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862253455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"神的恩赐，嗯...意思是，蒙神恩之人，就能自动获得这种魔法吗？\""}
{"time": 1753270301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070296973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“心净者，神以慈悲之力点化，启迪神智，免受疾病之苦”"}
{"time": 1753270341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479322961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:forward,id=7530238775706981479]"}
{"time": 1753270348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754523888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(龙p还是太多了)"}
{"time": 1753270360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776831575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我同学在明治神宫拍的)"}
{"time": 1753270387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513888695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（神了）"}
{"time": 1753270421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473112574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2070296973]\"嗯...但是作为塔的学者，我想解读这一魔法。主教认为有机会吗？\""}
{"time": 1753270485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049037662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“塔不会将我们视为异端？”"}
{"time": 1753270515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492368095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你感觉他笑眯眯的眼神有点瘆人"}
{"time": 1753270649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306415503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我本人就是异端。\"同样回敬了一个笑容"}
{"time": 1753270717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395431434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"主教大人要是愿意，现在可以把桃乐丝抓住，送到塔那边领赏。\"漫不经心地开口，\"塔的准则与我何干\""}
{"time": 1753271052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358725311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（木叶村叛忍）"}
{"time": 1753271099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107080607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哈哈哈，看来是我对你产生了不小的误会”"}
{"time": 1753271219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602073088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"误会?是塔的徽章让主教先生误会了吗？\"撑着脸笑，\"我只是想给出一项你不会拒绝的信物，抱歉啦\""}
{"time": 1753271661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495123905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我还以为塔里的人这么猖狂呢，甩个徽章就走”"}
{"time": 1753271705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565338316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是这样吗？我可是拜托梅露露亲说明了。\""}
{"time": 1753271711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089521123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“看来我的准备是白费了，不过这是好事”"}
{"time": 1753271760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984193667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，姑且不管主教大人的准备是什么，还是继续刚刚的议题吧。我想解读这一魔法，主教大人觉得有机会吗？\""}
{"time": 1753271896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836720374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "主教拿出一支笛子出来吹了一下，你透过窗户看见房子外面有几个人从隐蔽的地方走了出来，离开了这一片"}
{"time": 1753271915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335855498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "梅露露看到后也很惊讶，显然她不知道这些安排"}
{"time": 1753271967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869813452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“如果梅露露愿意的话。不过我可不认为这是能够解读出来的，毕竟此乃神赐”"}
{"time": 1753272006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413876932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"作为学者，我当然相信万物皆可解读\""}
{"time": 1753272038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045803453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "吐出这么句话，\"以现有的观点，我想将治愈看作是正能量的属性。\""}
{"time": 1753272152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413503006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"神赐的观点...嗯...老实说，我也信‘神‘，我相信一切神是事物的本质，皆可解读。这能不能也算是一种虔诚呢？主教大人。\"面带微笑，\"因此，请给我也洗礼一番如何\""}
{"time": 1753272517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936349590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“当然没问题，所有人都有资格接受洗礼，神不会拒绝任何一个人”"}
{"time": 1753272685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095847600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那么，请吧？\"摘下帽子放在桌上"}
{"time": 1753273002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081041662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（洗澡）"}
{"time": 1753274539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222432801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（怎么办）"}
